      "content": "fair enough. but if the security risks are manageable with the right standards, then it seems like the real blocker is just the companies protecting their bottom line. if you had to look at the long-term impact on the economy, do you think it's ultimately better for society to lean towards these aggressive antitrust regulations, or is the risk to our current tech stability too high to mess with?",
